      <data name="&lt;b&gt;Cost of Anonymity:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;Privacy:&lt;/b&gt; No UserID, IP, or Fingerprint is stored.&lt;br/&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;Tracking:&lt;/b&gt; You cannot see who has voted or not.&lt;br/&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;Dashboard:&lt;/b&gt; This poll will not show in users&apos; To-Do list.&lt;br/&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;Security:&lt;/b&gt; Cannot strictly prevent duplicate votes from the same device/person." xml:space="preserve">
